Placeholder: The Stift
[trigger none]

A placeholder encounter for The Stift arc.

choices:

* Explore = Search the court
    @if check combat correct:rush wrong:outlast {
        You find something valuable.
        +give_gold 25
        +finish_dungeon
    } @else {
        It doesn't go well.
        +add_condition injured
        +finish_dungeon
    }

* Negotiate = Talk your way through
    @if check negotiation correct:reason wrong:threaten {
        You find something valuable.
        +give_gold 25
        +finish_dungeon
    } @else {
        It doesn't go well.
        +add_condition injured
        +finish_dungeon
    }

* Depart = Leave this place behind
    You depart The Stift.
    +flee_dungeon
